            "created_at": "2025-07-12T13:20:52.505582+00:00",
            "notes": "[Legendary Loadout](item_81067d34-38fb-4057-9336-f387f75dfd5f) is core damage and gives you killing pressure. Try to fire the missiles from highgrounds onto their feet(not body). You can fly upwards and shoot your missiles as you fall down. This is important becuase it avoids most tanks and makes you harder to hit.\n\n[Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) is obvious, [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) will help you farm money early on. [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) is the alternative if you dont wanna take [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf). \n\nAP lifesteal is near useless on DVA from my experience, so dont waste money on  [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7).",
