            "created_at": "2025-07-12T13:20:52.505582+00:00",
            "notes": "[Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) is priority, then  [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2). This way we can maintain some weapon damage.\n\nIf balling you can get [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) for more damage, or even [Onslaught Ordinance](item_aa2a5d6d-0f8f-4b27-a44e-331832ec11fa)(instead of [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) and  [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) ) but I wouldnt get it if it means selling  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418). At that point you lose too much AP.\n\n## BELLOW ARE DEFENSIVE OPTIONS, I WILL NOT BE GOING OVER THEM AGAIN. YOU CAN BUY ANY OF THESE LATER ON IF YOU HAVE SPARE MONEY OR FEEL LIKE YOU NEED THEM.\n\nVS beam comps(or just one Zarya) you need to take [Plot Armor](item_d1427316-79d1-43a7-a608-67beb1595131). This isnt really optional VS Zarya .\n\n[Solo Spec](item_a2c2f7c3-761d-42d2-a11c-28980f027c8f) can be good VS spammy or high damage heroes that you can matrix, like Rein(AP), Soldier, Moira, Cass, Reaper or Freja.\n\n[Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) is the general option if you dont feel tanky enough.\n\n[Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) can be good if they have a lot of debuffs like Ana, Zen(Discord), Mei, Moira, Cass, JQ(wounds, ult) or Ashe.",
