            "notes": "[Overstocked](item_d6b946fd-0fd8-4ba1-85d0-601995136eb6) will give you a ton of firepower.\n\n[Onslaught Ordinance](item_aa2a5d6d-0f8f-4b27-a44e-331832ec11fa) is the most important item.\n\nIf enough money buy [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6), otherwise.\n\nIf not eough money stick to [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2).\n\nIf you are ballin get [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) and  [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2).\n\nIf small spare left [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) is excellent, same for [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0).",
