            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-12T13:20:52.505582+00:00",
            "notes": "[Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) is great, just get into the habit of holding M1 for a short time on anyone(fall off doesent matter) and it will instantly jump to 5 stacks(25% AP), THEN fire your missiles.\n\n[Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) makes you more tanky, basically 10% more HP as long as you maintain armor.\n\nIf you have a lot of cash and feel tanky enough you can take [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) over [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09). \n\nAnother possible upgrade is to replace  [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) with  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6).",
