            "created_at": "2025-07-12T13:20:52.505582+00:00",
            "notes": "At this point into the build you have to make a choice, either you go bomb or more missiles. I personally feel like this late into the game the 15% faster DVA bomb is very powerful. On top of that you earn ults pretty fast but they are useless on missile builds. The main choice you have to make is, if the enemy comp is easy to bomb or hard. Mobile enemies are harder to bomb and more stationary easier. If you are bad at BOMBING, then dont go bomb build.\n\nFor both variants, if enough money replace [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) with [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6).\n\n### VARIANT 1: BOMBER\n\n[Express Detonation](item_8da4cbad-78cb-4ebd-8bc4-8dc150afec95) and replace  [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) with [Dae-Hyun\u2019s Detonator](item_cf3e51e1-12c7-4d92-a68b-7742f98fe8fa). For our epic item we take [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4). Thats it, thats the core you need for BOMBING.\n\n### VARIANT 2: MORE MISSILES\n\nGet [CounterMeasures](item_1a15e568-079c-4d1f-a7e5-37219bd9b87f) for more missiles. Then just keep [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) and get [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) because the armor pairs well with [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09). Alternative is something is  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) or [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) for heal heavy enemies.",
