        {
            "id": "5726635a-9f1a-4d78-a17e-ba1bc5e51ee5",
            "build_id": "a5d212e8-8a07-4141-94d6-0ef54933933c",
            "round_number": 7,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-12T13:20:52.505582+00:00",
            "notes": "Again two versions, depending on what you took for 5th. However, the epic item is mostly the same.\n\n### BOMBER\n\n[CounterMeasures](item_1a15e568-079c-4d1f-a7e5-37219bd9b87f) for most games unless you feel like you arent tanky enough, then choose one of the other optional powers. \n\n[Ultrawide Matrix](item_403fe162-4a59-4a8e-8af9-5f83267228e8) is very solid and helps your team a bit more but also means more matrix.\n\n[FaceTanking](item_f8af63d1-1fd4-4758-86ce-96f1ef7ea1ea) if theres a lot of high damage heroes like Reaper, Cass, Freja or Soldier but I usually dont like it.\n\nWith the bomber, you cant really replace [Dae-Hyun\u2019s Detonator](item_cf3e51e1-12c7-4d92-a68b-7742f98fe8fa), so you are free to pick more expensive items, [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) should be kept too, for more ults. For the last item it's usually either [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) for anti heal when theres a lot of healing in enemy team or [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e).\n\n[Macro Missile](item_55f86238-d6d9-4419-9461-ca7c619c2f66) when you are hard winning and just blow people up.\n\n[Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) if slightly more tanky is needed. Could still be paired with [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) for a last second change by selling [Dae-Hyun\u2019s Detonator](item_cf3e51e1-12c7-4d92-a68b-7742f98fe8fa) if bombs havent worked and you need more tanky.\n\n### MISSILES\n\n[Ultrawide Matrix](item_403fe162-4a59-4a8e-8af9-5f83267228e8) should be the default power with the missile verison because its the perfect pairing for  [CounterMeasures](item_1a15e568-079c-4d1f-a7e5-37219bd9b87f).\n\nThe ones marked as stars I would generally keep and then add [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) if you havent already and  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e). If hard winning  [Macro Missile](item_55f86238-d6d9-4419-9461-ca7c619c2f66) can work. If not enough money, [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) over the last epic is the best choice because it has AP like an epic item. In most games you wont have enough money to replace [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) but if you have enough for two epics(full epic loadout) then go ahead and sell it for one of the other alternatives.",
